Vikram and Betal: The Honest Trader

King Vikram was carrying Betal through the forest once again.

Betal began his story.

“Once there was a trader who was known for his honesty,” said Betal. “People trusted him very much.”

One day, a customer gave him extra money by mistake.

The trader noticed it after the customer had left.

He could have kept the money, but he chose not to.

He went looking for the customer and returned the extra coins.

The customer was very happy and thanked him.

Later, more people heard about the trader’s honesty.

They began to trust him even more and brought him more business.

The trader became successful.

Betal then asked, “Vikram, why did the trader become successful?”

Vikram replied, “Because honesty builds trust, and trust brings success.”

As soon as Vikram spoke, Betal flew back to the tree.

💖 Moral:

Honesty builds trust and success.
